<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@/~cl_25> <https://schema.org/name> "Section 23 of the principal Act is amended-"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@/~cl_25> <https://schema.org/text> "( a ) in the national language text, by substituting for the words \"selama tempoh\" the words \"tidak melebihi\"; and ( b ) by substituting for the words \"five thousand ringgit\" the words \"one million ringgit\". Amendment of section 25"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@> .
