<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@/~cl_26> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 25 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words \"ten thousand ringgit\" the words \"one million ringgit\". Amendment of section 26"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@/~cl_27> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@> .
