<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Part I of the principal Act is amended by inserting after section 2 the following sections: \"Designated Labuan business activity 2A. (1) The Minister may, on the recommendation of the Director General, in writing, designate any activity carried on by any Labuan entity to be a Labuan business activity. (2) In designating a Labuan business activity under subsection (1), the Minister may approve the carrying out of such activity with residents or in the Malaysian currency. Labuan entity 2B. (1) The Labuan entities shall be as specified in the Schedule. (2) The Minister may, upon the recommendation of the Director General, by order published in the Gazette, amend the Schedule including for the purposes of declaring any other person as a Labuan entity.\". Labuan Offshore Business Activity Tax (Amendment) 5 Amendment of section 3"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2009/25/eng@> .
